<title>MALI: South Africa's Mbeki visits Mali.</title>
<headline>South Africa's Mbeki visits Mali.</headline>
<dateline>BAMAKO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Deputy Ppresident Thabo Mbeki visited the West African state of Mali for talks on increasing cooperation beyond that in the gold mining sector, Malian officials said.</p>
<p>Mbeki, who had talks with President Alpha Oumar Konare, arrived on Sunday for a 24-hour visit.</p>
</text>
